Credits
-------
myflames is inspired by Brendan Gregg's FlameGraph
(https://github.com/brendangregg/FlameGraph) and Tanel Poder's SQL Plan
FlameGraphs
(https://tanelpoder.com/posts/visualizing-sql-plan-execution-time-with-flamegraphs/).

